zhi-051-jiao:line024","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0028","quote":"皎"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-jiao","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0131","quote":"皎"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-huan","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027:m0009","quote":"皎"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-huan","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027:m0036","quote":"皎"}],"identity_note":"依本篇具名、稱謂及其所在原句辨認；引書原字存於各自來源。","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"y4x_cmp_976","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jing","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-jing","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jing:line011","quote":"　　孫靜字幼臺，堅季弟也。堅始舉事，靜糾合鄉曲及宗室五六百人以為保障，眾咸附焉。策破劉繇，定諸縣。進攻會稽，遣人請靜，靜將家屬與策會於錢唐。是時太守王朗拒策於固陵，策數渡水戰，不能克。靜說策曰：「朗負阻城守，難可卒拔。查瀆南去此數十里，而道之要徑也，宜從彼據其內，所謂攻其無備、出其不意者也。吾當自帥眾為軍前隊，破之必矣。」策曰：「善。」乃詐令軍中曰：「頃連雨水濁，兵飲之多腹痛，令促具罌缶數百口澄水。」至昏暮，羅以然火誑朗，便分軍夜投查瀆道，襲高遷屯。朗大驚。遣故丹楊太守周昕等帥兵前戰。策破昕等，斬之，遂定會稽。表拜靜為奮武校尉，欲授之重任，靜戀墳墓宗族，不樂出仕，求留鎮守。策從之。權統事，就遷昭義中郎將，終於家。有五子，暠、瑜、皎、奐、謙。暠三子：綽、超、恭。超為偏將軍。恭生峻。綽生綝。","source_term":"有五子，暠、瑜、皎、奐、謙"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu051-jing-3","interpretation_note":"本句所記父子；識別後綴不表示長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"y4x_cmp_976_BA","label":"孫胤","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[{"surface":"胤","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0166","c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0172"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-jiao","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0166","quote":"胤"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-jiao","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0172","quote":"胤"}],"identity_note":"依本篇具名、稱謂及其所在原句辨認；引書原字存於各自來源。","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"y4x_cmp_976_B","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-jiao","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024","quote":"　　皎得書，上疏陳謝，遂與寧結厚。後呂蒙當襲南郡，權欲令皎與蒙為左右部大督。蒙說權曰：「若至尊以征虜能，宜用之。以蒙能，宜用蒙。昔周瑜、程普為左右部督，共攻匯陵，雖事決於瑜，普自恃久將，且俱是督，遂共不睦，幾敗國事，此目前之戒也。」權寤，謝蒙曰：「以卿為大督，命皎為後繼。」禽關羽，定荊州，皖有力焉。建安二十四年卒。權追錄其功，封子胤為丹楊侯。胤卒，無子。弟晞嗣。領兵，有罪自殺，國除。弟咨、彌、儀，皆將軍，封侯。咨羽林督，儀無難督。咨為滕胤所殺，儀為孫峻所害。","source_term":"封子胤為丹楊侯"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu051-jiao-1","interpretation_note":"本句所記父子；識別後綴不表示長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-jiao","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao","raw_mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0166","c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0172"],"paragraph_ids":["c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0166","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0166"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0172","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-051-jiao:line024:m0172"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":2,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":2,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"2處獨立位置，2個原始錨點；0項為同